"{\n  \"AND\": {\n    \"left\": {\n      \"AND\": {\n        \"left\": {\n          \"AND\": {\n            \"left\": {\n              \"AND\": {\n                \"left\": {\n                  \"OR\": {\n                    \"left\": {\n                      \"raw_text\": \"Have a known or suspected allergy to trial product(s) or related products\"\n                    },\n                    \"right\": {\n                      \"raw_text\": \"or have a history of severe reaction to any component of the trial product(s)\"\n                    }\n                  }\n                },\n                \"right\": {\n                  \"OR\": {\n                    \"left\": {\n                      \"raw_text\": \"Have a history of uncontrolled or unstable medical condition, such as hypertension, diabetes, or cardiac disease\"\n                    },\n                    \"right\": {\n                      \"raw_text\": \"or have a history of significant organ dysfunction or disease, such as liver or kidney disease\"\n                    }\n                  }\n                }\n              }\n            },\n            \"right\": {\n              \"OR\": {\n                \"left\": {\n                  \"raw_text\": \"Have a history of substance abuse or addiction\"\n                },\n                \"right\": {\n                  \"raw_text\": \"or have a history of mental health disorder, such as depression, anxiety, or psychosis\"\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        \"right\": {\n          \"OR\": {\n            \"left\": {\n              \"raw_text\": \"Have previously enrolled in this study\"\n            },\n            \"right\": {\n              \"raw_text\": \"or have been previously randomized in this trial\"\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    \"right\": {\n      \"OR\": {\n        \"left\": {\n          \"raw_text\": \"Females of childbearing potential who are pregnant, breast-feeding or intend to become pregnant or are not using adequate contraceptive methods\"\n        },\n        \"right\": {\n          \"raw_text\": \"or have a history of infertility or have had a hysterectomy or bilateral oophorectomy\"\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}"